spans.s:
चिन्त् चिन्तयति चिन्तय˚ते pp. चिन्तित (q.v.) think,
reflect, consider, find out, invent;
 think of, care for (acc., dat.,
loc., or प्रति);
 w. neg. not care for, not mind. — अनु meditate,
consider, call to mind. समनु & अभि consider, ponder upon (acc.).
परि meditate, ponder, think of, find out. प्र reflect, consider;
invent. वि discern, observe, meditate, think of (acc.) or to (inf.),
consider, regard, imagine, invent. सम् think, meditate, consider.

चिन्तन n. thinking of, consideration, reflection;
 care
for (gen. or —˚).

चिन्तामणि m. the gem of thought ( = the philosopher's
stone);
 T. of sev. works.

चिन्तित n. thought, reflection;
 anxiety, sorrow;
 purpose,
design.
